Subject: [PATCH] payments: retain disabled UI and readable historical payment
 data

Keep the reference disabled-feature boundary without restoring MobileCoin UI/dependencies. Persisted compatibility remains owned by storage migrations.

Extract final intent, not historical commit replay. All blobs/modes in this
boundary come from untouched Molly 892d6264ba007b5458a8b74cf9183c665f1f17a1.
SOURCE ledger: e8f627b41b4358bfc78d7c410d2e5c8f12e934481682c0389750efb2bbcac00f
Feature families: MOL-PAY-001
Dependencies: preceding cumulative extraction boundaries; validate the completed stack.
Validation: final GNU app JVM/package/lint and exact reference tree/resource/API comparison;
runtime parity and independent review remain separate parent gates.

